{"updated":"2026-10-26T13:42:43.495Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Lula wins Brazil election but faces uphill battle to govern. Elsewhere, anthropic unveils details of planned historic stock market debut. And US foreign aid to Israel highlighted in campaign ad in support of El-Sayed. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though Israel, and US are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 1.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.1 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 3.8 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 35 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.5 near 283 km E of Levuka, Fiji. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.15,0.2,0.23,0.27,0.33,0.36,0.4,0.44,0.49,0.51,0.53,0.57,0.59,0.64,0.76,0.85,1,1.32,1.44,1.49,1.52,1.54,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.66,1.71,1.75,1.82,1.88,1.93,1.96,2,2.04,2.08,2.1,2.17,2.22,2.25,2.29,2.33,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.59,2.65,2.72,2.83,2.95,3.1,3.12,3.17,3.19,3.25,3.3,3.35,3.47,3.55,3.61,3.68,3.71,3.76,3.8,3.84,3.89,3.91,3.94,3.98,4,4.03,4.05,4.1,4.14,4.23,4.28,4.35,4.41,4.47,4.53,4.57,4.62,4.64,4.69,4.81,4.96,5.13,5.74,5.83,5.94,6.01,6.11,6.19,6.24,6.35,6.44,6.5,6.56,6.61,6.65,6.71,6.77,6.86,6.91,6.97,7.01,7.07,7.14,7.21,7.26,7.3,7.35,7.43,7.61,7.67,7.73,7.77,7.83,7.87,7.96,8.03,8.13,8.17,8.27,8.38,8.44,8.51,8.56,8.6,8.64,8.71,8.75,8.81,8.86,8.93,8.97,9.02,9.06,9.09,9.13,9.2,9.24,9.31,9.36,9.39,9.44,9.55,9.67,10.05,10.17,10.23,10.29,10.33,10.38,10.44,10.47,10.53,10.65,10.69,10.79,10.9,10.97,11.03,11.08,11.12,11.18,11.24,11.3,11.34,11.41,11.45,11.53,11.6,11.68,11.74,11.82,11.87,11.92,11.98,12.06,12.14,12.21,12.26,12.33,12.38,12.42,12.45,12.48,12.54,12.59,12.64,12.71,12.76,12.81,12.85,12.88,12.92,12.96,13,13.06,13.13,13.2,13.27,13.32,13.36,13.42,13.47,13.5